+                 * The cell cache first, exactly as the stack VM's OP_get_var
+                 * does before it calls JS_GetGlobalVar. A filled cell has
+                 * already passed the TDZ test, and both a write of
+                 * JS_UNINITIALIZED into global_var_obj and any change to the
